        "Business Description": "Dreamland Cocoa is a vertically integrated cocoa and chocolate startup founded by the children and grandchildren of cocoa farmers in West Africa. Built by people with deep generational ties to agriculture, the company is rooted in firsthand experience of the challenges facing cocoa farming.\n\nThrough our families and strategic partners, we own and operate cocoa farms in Ghana, giving us direct control over quality, sustainability, and farmer livelihoods. Our mission is to increase the value captured by farmers, reduce child labour, and restore profitability to cocoa production.\nWe enter the market through high-demand, value-added products such as chocolate-coated cashew nuts and groundnut snacks, using these products as a scalable pathway into broader chocolate production. By combining cocoa and cashew value chains, we create stronger economic incentives for farmers, reduce pressure to convert farmland into illegal mining, and build a profitable, ethical, and sustainable agri-processing business.",
